[Term]
id: GO:0001680
name: tRNA 3'-terminal CCA addition
namespace: biological_process
def: "Post-transcriptional addition of the terminal 3' CCA sequence to a tRNA which does not encode this sequence within the primary transcript. CCA addition proceeds by the sequential addition of CTP, CTP, and then ATP to the 3' end of the tRNA, yielding a diphosphate with each nucleotide addition." [EC:2.7.7.72, GOC:go_curators]
