namespace: cellular_component
def: "An enzyme complex that catalyzes the phosphorylation of phosphorylase b to form phosphorylase a." [EC:2.7.11.19]
is_a: GO:1902554 ! serine/threonine protein kinase complex
relationship: part_of GO:0005737 ! cytoplasm

[Term]
id: GO:0005965
