is_a: GO:0014038 ! regulation of Schwann cell differentiation
is_a: GO:0045687 ! positive regulation of glial cell differentiation
relationship: positively_regulates GO:0014037 ! Schwann cell differentiation

[Term]
id: GO:0014041
