name: regulation of endo-1,4-beta-xylanase activity
namespace: biological_process
def: "Any process that modulates the frequency, rate or extent of endo-(1->4)-beta-xylanase activity, the catalysis of the endohydrolysis of (1->4)-beta-D-xylosidic linkages in xylans." [EC:3.2.1.8, GOC:ai]
