namespace: biological_process
def: "Any process that stops or reduces the rate of endo-(1->4)-beta-xylanase activity, the catalysis of the endohydrolysis of (1->4)-beta-D-xylosidic linkages in xylans." [EC:3.2.1.8, GOC:ai]
