is_a: GO:0048731 ! system development

[Term]
id: GO:0061009
name: common bile duct development
namespace: biological_process
def: "The progression of the common bile duct over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The common bile duct is formed from the joining of the common hepatic duct running from the liver, and the cystic duct running from the gall bladder. The common bile duct transports bile from the liver and gall bladder to the intestine." [PMID:20614624]
