namespace: biological_process
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of a metanephric glomerular visceral epithelial cell over time, from its formation to the mature structure. A metanephric glomerular visceral epithelial cell is a specialized epithelial cell that contains 'feet' that interdigitate with the 'feet' of other glomerular epithelial cells in the metanephros." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
is_a: GO:0072015 ! podocyte development
is_a: GO:0072313 ! metanephric glomerular epithelial cell development
relationship: part_of GO:0072248 ! metanephric podocyte differentiation
