[Term]
id: GO:0072292
name: epithelial cell migration involved in metanephric proximal tubule morphogenesis
namespace: biological_process
def: "The orderly movement of epithelial cells within a renal tubule that contributes to metanephric proximal tubule morphogenesis." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
