[Term]
id: GO:0090388
name: phagosome-lysosome docking involved in apoptotic cell clearance
namespace: biological_process
def: "The initial attachment of a phagosome membrane to a lysosome membrane that occurs as a part of apoptotic cell clearance. Docking requires only that the proteins come close enough to interact and adhere." [GOC:kmv, GOC:tb]
is_a: GO:0090384 ! phagosome-lysosome docking
relationship: part_of GO:0090387 ! phagolysosome assembly involved in apoptotic cell clearance

[Term]
id: GO:0090389
