[Term]
id: GO:0090392
name: sepal giant cell differentiation
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process in which a relatively unspecialized cell acquires specialized features of a sepal giant cell. A sepal giant cell is a pavement cell that is part of the sepal epidermis and stretches one fifth the length of the sepal with a chromosome content of 16C." [GOC:tb, PMID:20485493]
