def: "OBSOLETE. The biogenesis of a mitochondrial respiratory chain complex III (also known as cytochrome bc(1) complex or ubiquinol-cytochrome c reductase), a protein complex located in the mitochondrial inner membrane that forms part of the mitochondrial respiratory chain. Includes the synthesis of constituent proteins and their aggregation, arrangement and bonding together." [GOC:mcc]
