namespace: biological_process
def: "The clustering process in which gephyrin molecules are localized to distinct domains in the postsynaptic density as part of postsynaptic density assembly. Gephyrin is a component of the postsynaptic protein network of inhibitory synapses." [GOC:BHF, GOC:sjp, PMID:15620359, PMID:24552784, PMID:25772192]
is_a: GO:0035418 ! protein localization to synapse
