is_a: GO:0097212 ! lysosomal membrane organization

[Term]
id: GO:0097214
name: positive regulation of lysosomal membrane permeability
namespace: biological_process
def: "Any process that increases the frequency, rate or extent of the passage or uptake of molecules by the lysosomal membrane." [GOC:yaf, PMID:20544854]
is_a: GO:0097213 ! regulation of lysosomal membrane permeability
is_a: GO:1905710 ! positive regulation of membrane permeability

[Term]
id: GO:0097215
name: negative regulation of lysosomal membrane permeability
namespace: biological_process
