namespace: biological_process
def: "OBSOLETE. Any process that activates or increases the frequency, rate or extent of fatty acid beta-oxidation by activating or increasing the frequency, rate or extent of transcription from an RNA polymerase II promoter." [GOC:dgf, PMID:1899286]

[Term]
