namespace: biological_process
def: "The transfer of an assembled iron-sulfur cluster from a scaffold protein to an acceptor protein that contributes to the attainment of the full functional capacity of a protein." [GOC:al, GOC:mah, PMID:11939799, PMID:18322036, PMID:21977977]
is_a: GO:0051604 ! protein maturation

[Term]
