is_a: GO:0016300 ! tRNA (uracil) methyltransferase activity

[Term]
id: GO:0097698
name: telomere maintenance via base-excision repair
namespace: biological_process
def: "A telomere maintenance process that occurs by base-excision repair of telomeric DNA in response to DNA damage. Telomeric sequences are particularly susceptible to oxidative DNA damage, due to their G-rich nature." [GOC:BHF, GOC:BHF_telomere, GOC:jbu, PMID:24703901]
is_a: GO:0006284 ! base-excision repair
is_a: GO:0043247 ! telomere maintenance in response to DNA damage

