namespace: cellular_component
def: "A protein complex which assembles on the mother centriole during cilium formation, adjacent and proximal to a centriolar distal appendage. In human, it contains ODF2, CNTRL, NIN, CCDC120c and CCDC68." [GOC:cilia, PMID:23213374, PMID:27818179, PMID:28422092]
is_a: GO:0032991 ! protein-containing complex
relationship: part_of GO:0005929 ! cilium

