[Term]
id: GO:1990140
name: MPT synthase complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A heterodimeric protein complex which catalyses sulfur transfer from the sulfur carrier subunit of MPT synthase to precursor Z to synthesize MPT as part of molybdopterin cofactor (Moco) biosynthesis. In E. coli the subunits are MoaE and MoaD; in human, MOCS2B and MOCS2A. Moco biosynthesis and its constituent molecules are evolutionarily conserved." [GOC:bhm, PMID:11135669, PMID:16669776, Reactome:R-HSA-947581]
