is_a: GO:0019904 ! protein domain specific binding

[Term]
id: GO:1990445
name: obsolete Multiciliate cell differentiation
namespace: biological_process
def: "OBSOLETE. The process in which a relatively unspecialized cell acquires features of a multiciliated cell, a specialized epithelial cell type that extends anywhere from 150 to 200 motile cilia per cell in order to produce a vigorous fluid flow critical to human health in several organ systems." [PMID:22231168, PMID:24934224]

[Term]
id: GO:1990446
name: U1 snRNP binding
namespace: molecular_function
