[Term]
id: GO:1990456
name: mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tethering
namespace: biological_process
def: "The attachment of a mitochondrion and an endoplasmic reticulum via molecular tethers that physically bridge their respective membranes and attach them to each other. The tethering may facilitate exchange of metabolites between the organelles." [PMID:19556461, PMID:27875684]
is_a: GO:0016043 ! cellular component organization
is_a: GO:0140056 ! organelle localization by membrane tethering

[Term]
id: GO:1990457
