namespace: molecular_function
def: "OBSOLETE. Catalyzes the condensation of dimethylallyl diphosphate and isopentenyl diphosphate to geranyl diphosphate, the key precursor of monoterpene biosynthesis." [GOC:mengo_curators, PMID:10557273]
