[Term]
id: GO:1990483
name: Clr6 histone deacetylase complex I''
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A histone deacetylase complex involved in chromatin organization. In Schizosaccharomyces pombe this complex consists of Clr6, Nts1, Mug165, and Png3." [PMID:25002536]
